ectric drill today and experience the difference for yourself. Visit our website or your nearest retailer to get yours now!\\n\\n[The scene fades to black as the brand logo and website information appear on the screen.]\\n\\nNarrator: Electric drills - the future of DIY.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 268}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720092107, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hEp17JQLJTbT6Ntfyhq1gbfa9ktr\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Scene: A happy baby playing with toys in a brightly lit nursery. The camera zooms in on the baby's smiling face as a voiceover begins.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Introducing the most comfortable and reliable nappies on the market - [Brand Name] Nappies! \\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of the nappy, showcasing its soft and breathable material.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Our nappies are designed with your baby's comfort in mind. With a snug fit and ultra-absorbent core, [Brand Name] Nappies keep your little one dry and happy all day long.\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different babies wearing the nappies and happily playing or sleeping.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Whether it's playtime, naptime, or bedtime, [Brand Name] Nappies provide leak protection and peace of mind for parents. Say goodbye to leaks and accidents with our trusted nappies.\\n\\n[Cut back to the happy baby playing in the nursery, now wearing a clean and dry nappy.]\\n\\nVoiceover: Choose the best for your baby. Choose [Brand Name] Nappies. Available now at your nearest retailer.\\n\\n[End with the brand logo and tagline on the screen.]\\n\\nVoiceover: [Brand Name] Nappies - Because your baby deserves the best.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 264}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720092110, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hEp4gfhqwrpjRWQo8WtyodLm0B1o\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a science museum\", \"response\": \"[The camera fades in to a bustling science museum, with