ur local hardware store.\\n\\n[Scene: The homeowner holds up the electric drill with a thumbs up as the screen fades to black.]\\n\\nNarrator: Electric Drill - the power tool you never knew you needed.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 267}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720095839, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFnDEifxrVKXofF1ft9ikq0nNnEh\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting nappies\", \"response\": \"[Scene opens with a smiling baby playing happily in a crib]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Introducing the newest innovation in baby care - the all-new Super Soft Nappies!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of the nappies with a soft, breathable material]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Our nappies are designed with ultra-absorbent technology to keep your baby dry and comfortable all day and night.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of different babies wearing the nappies and moving around freely]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With a snug and secure fit, our nappies allow your little one to move and play without any leaks or discomfort.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a happy parent changing their baby's nappy]\\n\\nParent: \\\"I love how soft and gentle these nappies are on my baby's skin. And they never leak, even overnight!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the nappies packaging with the tagline: \\\"Super Soft Nappies - Because your baby deserves the best\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Try Super Soft Nappies today and see the difference for yourself. Your baby will thank you!\\\"\\n\\n[Fade to black with the sound of a baby giggling]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Super Soft Nappies - the perfect choice for your little one's comfort and protection.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 259}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720095848, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFnMKWDZF8lrbG9duvPTmM6pbx3S\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a science museum\", \"response\": \"[Open with a shot of a bustling science museum filled with families and children explorin