er you're a beginner or an experienced yogi, our classes are open to all levels.\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of people of different ages and fitness levels practicing yoga poses]\\n\\nNarrator: Our classes are designed to help you connect with your body, mind, and spirit. You'll learn to breathe deeply, move mindfully, and find inner peace in a supportive and non-judgmental environment.\\n\\n[Cut to a group of students chatting and laughing after a class]\\n\\nStudent 1: I never thought I could do yoga, but this class has changed my life!\\n\\nStudent 2: I feel so much more relaxed and centered after each session.\\n\\nNarrator: So what are you waiting for? Join us for a class today and start your journey to a healthier and happier you. Visit our website or give us a call to book your spot now!\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the yoga studio logo and contact information]\\n\\nNarrator: Yoga - because a healthy body and mind are the keys to a fulfilling life. See you on the mat!\\n\\n[Fade to black]\\n\\nVoiceover: Brought to you by [Yoga Studio Name]. Embrace the power of yoga today.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 359}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720095882, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFnuMi7A4rarvJuOQTK4G7lr8f9e\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[Opening shot of a group of people lifting weights in a gym, with energetic music playing in the background]\\n\\nNarrator: Are you tired of the same old workout routine? Looking to challenge yourself and push your limits?\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of a weightlifting bar being loaded with weights]\\n\\nNarrator: Look no further! Introducing our weightlifting class, where you can build strength, tone your muscles, and achieve your fitness goals.\\n\\n[Cut to footage of a diverse group of people of all ages and fitness levels working out together in the class]\\n\\nNarrator: Our experienced trainers will guide you through each session,