ts. Make dishwashing a breeze.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 272}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720096102, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFrSQAWjl1SStyzJNfGTfat4WBzM\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a vacuum cleaner\", \"response\": \"[The commercial opens with a shot of a messy living room, with crumbs and dust scattered all over the floor. The camera then zooms in on a sleek and modern vacuum cleaner sitting in the corner.]\\n\\nNarrator: Are you tired of spending hours cleaning your floors, only to find dust and dirt still lingering around?\\n\\n[Cut to a frustrated woman trying to clean her floors with a broom and dustpan, looking exasperated.]\\n\\nNarrator: Introducing the new and improved UltraVac 3000! The ultimate solution to all your cleaning woes.\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of the UltraVac 3000 in action, effortlessly sucking up dirt and debris from the floor.]\\n\\nNarrator: With its powerful suction and advanced filtration system, the UltraVac 3000 ensures a thorough and efficient clean every time.\\n\\n[Cut to a satisfied customer smiling and nodding in approval as they use the UltraVac 3000 to clean their home.]\\n\\nCustomer: I can't believe how easy it is to use! It's like a breath of fresh air for my home.\\n\\nNarrator: Say goodbye to dusty floors and hello to a cleaner, healthier living space with the UltraVac 3000.\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the UltraVac 3000 logo and contact information on the screen.]\\n\\nNarrator: Order yours today and experience the difference for yourself. The UltraVac 3000 \\u2013 cleaning made easy.\\n\\n[The commercial ends with a final shot of the UltraVac 3000 in action, leaving behind a sparkling clean floor.]\\n\\nNarrator: UltraVac 3000. The power to clean.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 324}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720096107, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFrXq7pn683wviJ28HWGGF3gMoLa\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for a