st importantly, our classes provide a supportive and welcoming community for you to connect with others on a similar journey.\\n\\n[Closing shot of the yoga studio with the logo and contact information displayed]\\n\\nVoiceover: Find your center with us. Sign up for a class today and start your journey to a healthier, happier you.\\n\\n[End with a calming instrumental music playing in the background]\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 250}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720096300, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFueGW23dgZb79VNEJFYWv7icso4\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a weightlifting class\", \"response\": \"[The camera fades in to show a gym setting with weights and exercise equipment in the background. A group of people are seen lifting weights and working out with determination.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Are you ready to take your fitness journey to the next level? Do you want to build strength, tone your muscles, and feel more confident in your own skin?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up of a weightlifting instructor, who is motivating and guiding the class members.]\\n\\nInstructor: \\\"Join our weightlifting class and see real results! Our experienced trainers will help you perfect your form, increase your strength, and reach your fitness goals.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of class members high-fiving each other and smiling after a challenging workout.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned lifter, our class is designed for all fitness levels. You'll be surrounded by a supportive community that will push you to be your best self.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a class member giving a testimonial.]\\n\\nClass Member: \\\"I never thought I could lift this much weight, but with the guidance of the instructors and the support of my classmates, I've seen incredible progress in just a few weeks.\\\"\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Don't wait any longer to transform your body and your mindset. Sign up for our weightliftin