day and start your journey towards healing and self-discovery.\\n\\n[Fade to black with the message: \\\"Therapy: Because your mental health matters.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: Therapy - because everyone deserves to feel heard and supported.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 322}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720096458, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hFxCAh0a9KQ7RV1jSb0tlaFVVeJ0\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a group of friends laughing and having a good time at a backyard barbecue. The sun is shining, and everyone is enjoying themselves.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Looking for the perfect drink to elevate your summer gatherings? Look no further than our delicious and refreshing beer!\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to close-up shots of the beer being poured into a frosty glass, showcasing the golden color and frothy head.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Crafted with care and passion, our beer is the perfect companion for any occasion. Whether you're grilling with friends, relaxing by the pool, or cheering on your favorite team, our beer is sure to enhance the moment.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to shots of friends clinking their glasses together and taking a sip, with smiles on their faces.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"With its crisp and clean taste, our beer is a crowd-pleaser that will have everyone coming back for more. So why settle for anything less? Choose our beer for your next gathering and elevate your experience.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a final shot of the beer bottle with the logo displayed prominently.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Pick up a pack today and taste the difference for yourself. Cheers to good times and great beer!\\\"\\n\\n[Fade to black with the sound of friends laughing and clinking glasses in the background.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Our beer. Crafted for moments like these. Drink responsibly.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 276}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720096462, \"id\"