kens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 343}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720097107, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hG7fzeEWFk6IqoPgBIF6FTsaIfHj\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a washing machine\", \"response\": \"[The ad opens with a woman struggling to hand wash a large pile of dirty laundry]\\n\\nNarrator: Tired of spending hours hand washing your clothes? Introducing the all-new UltraWash Washing Machine!\\n\\n[Cut to a sleek, modern washing machine with a digital display]\\n\\nNarrator: With its state-of-the-art technology, the UltraWash Washing Machine is designed to make laundry day a breeze.\\n\\n[Cut to various shots of the washing machine in action - washing clothes, spinning, and rinsing]\\n\\nNarrator: With multiple wash cycles and settings, you can customize each load to ensure your clothes come out clean and fresh every time.\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the woman smiling as she takes out a load of clean laundry from the washing machine]\\n\\nNarrator: Say goodbye to hand washing and hello to more free time with the UltraWash Washing Machine.\\n\\n[Cut to the washing machine logo and contact information]\\n\\nNarrator: Visit our website or call us today to order your UltraWash Washing Machine and make laundry day a whole lot easier. UltraWash - the future of laundry is here.\\n\\n[End with a shot of the woman happily folding her clean laundry, looking relieved and satisfied]\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 243}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720097111, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hG7jWd3wKtZ8gJA4ZXEhXrpIUgux\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting dishwasher tablets\", \"response\": \"[Scene: A busy kitchen with dirty dishes piled up in the sink]\\n\\nNarrator: Tired of spending hours scrubbing dirty dishes by hand? Introducing the ultimate solution - our powerful dishwasher tablets!\\n\\n[Cut to a close-up shot of the dishwasher tablet being placed in the dishwasher]\\n\\nNarrator: Our specially formulat