f club.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to footage of golfers teeing off, hitting perfect shots, and celebrating their victories]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"At our club, you'll have access to top-of-the-line facilities, expert instructors, and a tight-knit community of fellow golf enthusiasts.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a group of friends enjoying a drink on the patio overlooking the course]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether you're a seasoned pro or a newcomer to the game, our club offers something for everyone. From social events to tournaments, we have it all.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a montage of golfers of all ages and skill levels enjoying the course and improving their game]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Join us at our club and experience the joy of golf like never before. Take your game to the next level and create memories that will last a lifetime.\\\"\\n\\n[Closing shot of the club logo and contact information]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Contact us today to learn more and start your journey to becoming a better golfer. Our club is waiting for you.\\\" \\n\\n[End with a shot of golfers high-fiving and smiling on the green]\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 268}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720097195, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hG95hjhBe50JesdhN30JiOkxpYJQ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Open with soothing music playing in the background as the camera pans across a serene office space with comfortable chairs and a calming color palette.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Are you feeling overwhelmed by stress, anxiety, or depression? Do you find yourself struggling to cope with life's challenges?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a diverse group of people, each looking stressed or unhappy, sitting in a circle in a therapy session. The therapist, a warm and compassionate individual, is leading the group in a discussion.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"It's time to take care of yourself and prioritize your mental health. Therapy can provide you with the tools and support you need to 