people bustling by. Camera pans to a woman, SARAH, looking frustrated as she tries to zip up her jeans.]\\n\\nNarrator: Are you tired of struggling to lose weight?\\n\\n[Cut to Sarah looking defeated as she tries on a dress that doesn't fit.]\\n\\nNarrator: Introducing our revolutionary weight loss programme that guarantees real results!\\n\\n[Cut to Sarah smiling and confidently walking down the street in a smaller size dress.]\\n\\nNarrator: With personalized meal plans, expert guidance, and ongoing support, you'll finally achieve the body you've always wanted.\\n\\n[Cut to Sarah working out with a personal trainer and smiling as she steps on the scale to reveal her weight loss progress.]\\n\\nNarrator: Say goodbye to crash diets and fad trends. Our programme is designed to help you make sustainable lifestyle changes for long-lasting results.\\n\\n[Cut to Sarah sitting down with a nutritionist and discussing her progress.]\\n\\nNarrator: Start your journey to a healthier, happier you today. Call now to book your free consultation and take the first step towards a new you.\\n\\n[End with a shot of Sarah happily shopping for new clothes in a smaller size.]\\n\\nNarrator: Don't wait any longer. Transform your life with our weight loss programme. Call now!\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 18, \"completion_tokens\": 257}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720097809, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hGIzjeHiZ2yeXgeSrjgnz31AdikZ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a lawnmower\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a lush green lawn and a homeowner struggling to push a manual lawnmower]\\n\\nNarrator: Tired of spending hours mowing your lawn the old-fashioned way? It's time to upgrade to the latest in lawn care technology - the new XYZ lawnmower!\\n\\n[Cut to a sleek, modern lawnmower sitting on the lawn]\\n\\nNarrator: With its powerful engine and precision blades, the XYZ lawnmower will make quick work of even the toughest grass. Say goodbye to sore