hether you're dealing with depression, trauma, relationship issues, or simply need someone to talk to, therapy can provide you with the support and guidance you need to thrive.\\n\\n[Closing shot: A smiling individual walking out of a therapy session feeling relieved and empowered]\\n\\nNarrator: Take the first step towards a happier and healthier you. Contact us today to schedule your therapy session and start your journey towards healing.\\n\\n[Logo and contact information displayed on screen]\\n\\nNarrator: Therapy - because your mental health matters.\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 276}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720098387, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hGSJrTMba7RylHE6SFb30B8FuI1r\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting beer\", \"response\": \"[Open on a group of friends sitting around a campfire, laughing and enjoying themselves]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Looking to add a little excitement to your next gathering?\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a close up shot of a cold, refreshing beer being poured into a glass]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Introducing [Brand Name] Beer - the perfect companion for good times and great memories.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to shots of friends clinking their glasses together and taking sips of the beer]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"With its crisp, smooth taste and refreshing finish, [Brand Name] Beer is sure to be a hit with your crew.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a group of friends raising their glasses in a toast]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"So why settle for anything less? Grab a cold one and make every moment unforgettable with [Brand Name] Beer.\\\"\\n\\n[End with the brand's logo and tagline on the screen]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Cheers to good times and great beer. [Brand Name] Beer - Raise a glass to the good life.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 206}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720098391, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hGSN7FiFxhOq4aZKBVy3YtKnQkk6\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an adver