es. Visit [brand website] to shop now.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 15, \"completion_tokens\": 344}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720098466, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hGTarZvnIMbVdxjc1YBzCyiWzv5L\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting bubble bath\", \"response\": \"[The scene opens with a woman coming home after a long day at work. She looks tired and stressed as she enters her bathroom.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"After a long day, sometimes all you need is a little bit of me-time to relax and unwind.\\\"\\n\\n[The woman starts running a warm bath and pours in some bubble bath liquid. The bubbles start to form and the room fills with a soothing, calming scent.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Introducing our luxurious bubble bath, perfect for creating your own personal oasis right at home.\\\"\\n\\n[The woman sinks into the bath, closing her eyes and letting out a contented sigh as she relaxes in the warm water.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Our bubble bath is specially formulated to nourish your skin and help you unwind after a stressful day.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of the woman emerging from the bath, her skin looking soft and glowing.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Treat yourself to a little luxury with our bubble bath. Because you deserve it.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the brand logo and slogan.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Bubble bath - for those moments of pure relaxation.\\\"\", \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 225}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720098470, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9hGTePuzexqqrdEdoEICZZXcnWxnO\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting curtains\", \"response\": \"[The advert opens with a cozy living room setting, with the sunlight filtering through the windows. A woman is seen struggling to close the curtains, which are old and tattered.]\\n\\nNarrator: Are your curtains looking tired and worn out? Do they let in too much light, or fail to provide the privacy you need?\\n\\n[The camera zoom